                <span id="alg4.l5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="alg4.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\rm{metric}}_{*}\leftarrow 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">metric</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\rm{metric}}_{*}\leftarrow 0</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg4.l5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg4.l5.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="alg4.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Determines final model
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg4.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg4.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">6:</span></span>
                  
                  
                <span id="alg4.l6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="alg4.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sdmVerificationLayer_{*}\leftarrow\sdmVerificationLayer" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps" mathsize="0.900em">verificationLayer</mtext><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps" mathsize="0.900em">verificationLayer</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sdmVerificationLayer_{*}\leftarrow\sdmVerificationLayer</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg4.l6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg4.l6.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="alg4.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Final <math id="alg4.l6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sdm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">sdm</mtext><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sdm</annotation></semantics></math> activation layer for verification
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg4.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg4.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">7:</span></span>
                  
                  
                <span id="alg4.l7.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="alg4.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{E}}_{*}\leftarrow{\mathcal{E}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℰ</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℰ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{E}}_{*}\leftarrow{\mathcal{E}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg4.l7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg4.l7.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="alg4.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Final <math id="alg4.l7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sdm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">sdm</mtext><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sdm</annotation></semantics></math> estimator (i.e., <math id="alg4.l7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\EstimatorPLower" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo mathsize="1.110em">^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>lower</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\EstimatorPLower</annotation></semantics></math>) for verification
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg4.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg4.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">8:</span></span>
                  
                  
                <span id="alg4.l8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="alg4.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{\rm{step}}\leftarrow\frac{\beta_{\rm{max}}-\beta_{\rm{min}}}{\rm{total~mini~batches}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">β</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">step</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">β</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">max</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">β</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">min</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">total</mi><mo lspace="0.260em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">mini</mi><mo lspace="0.260em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">batches</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{\rm{step}}\leftarrow\frac{\beta_{\rm{max}}-\beta_{\rm{min}}}{\rm{total~mini~batches}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg4.l8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg4.l8.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="alg4.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Used to calculate <math id="alg4.l8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math> as a function of epoch progress
</span>
</div>
